  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:8px\">.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#333\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/269/823/no_recipe_book-header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"395\" height=\"95\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#333\"><strong style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">無配方書</span></strong><strong style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:12px\">會從玩家物品欄與合成介面，以及其他含有該功能的介面中移除配方書圖示。<br></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">此為客戶端模組，無需安裝在伺服器端。若安裝於伺服器端，將不會產生任何效果。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">.</span>&nbsp;<br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/251/207/playerinventory.png\" alt=\"玩家物品欄\" width=\"514\" height=\"235\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/251/208/craftinginventory.png\" alt=\"合成介面\" width=\"510\" height=\"237\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
